{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026FxWwlRYgsk1792830023.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>警方拘捕一名34歲男子，涉嫌在石硤尾公園的貓糧內放置老鼠藥，事件中未有貓受傷。</p><p></p><p>貓義工截停身穿跑步裝束的可疑人士後，與他對質。放在石硤尾公園內的貓糧變成黑色，旁邊有懷疑混入老鼠藥的藍色液體。</p><p></p><p>\n<p>\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.CAT 1600_003.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026IzDbQMvHPe1792830048.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/>\n</p>\n</p><p></p><p>警方表示，凌晨3時許接獲一名女子報案，指懷疑有人在公園的貓糧內放入老鼠藥。警員到場後，在一名34歲男子身上搜獲一包懷疑老鼠藥，及一把約14厘米長的生果刀。初步調查後，以涉嫌殘酷對待動物以及管有攻擊性武器將他拘捕。案件中沒有貓受傷。</p><p></p><p>\n<p>\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.CAT 1600_001.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026sdgPjMbifs1792830036.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/>\n</p>\n</p><p></p><p>報案的動物保護團體表示，由8月中開始，在公園內餵飼流浪貓的貓糧內發現不明液體，於是設閉路電視觀察，發現有人形跡可疑，最終報警。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-24T10:03:08.118184+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":275,"images":3,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-24T07:17:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-25T07:51:13.802325+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-24T09:58:18.825540+00:00","content_hash":"4ab0279eaaa4b0d7d7bf7b79d5e337001b72998ff3f6e63b66844de4e33a1c42","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-24T10:03:08.118184+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}